+🔧 Independent product review identified that the two added optional indexes
+were created before `max_page_count` was applied. An existing full diagnostics
+database could grow during startup, after which SQLite cannot lower the ceiling
+below its actual page count. Moving the ceiling earlier would instead make
+index creation fail and disable the store, including Operator export and clear.
