+the primary key handles exact retries. Actor-window and scoped-copy queries run
+in the existing bounded worker over the at-most-64-MiB source. No acceptance
+requires these additional indexes, and a schema fallback framework would add
+unnecessary state. This preserves the deliberately retained preproduction store
+without adding a general production-migration feature.
