+## 🔗 Feedback and observation expiry integration
+
+**Accepted carry-forward contract — agent judgment, 2026-11-14**, preserving
+the owner’s October 27 retention direction and October 29 paired-export scope.
+Actual seven-day observation expiry remains open SPN-110 work, effort M; this
+record does not implement or declare acceptance of TTL maintenance.
+
+Whichever of SPN-098 and SPN-110 lands second must preserve durable submitted
+feedback, flags and idempotent acknowledgments while expiring only observations
+by trusted receipt time. An already prepared bounded immutable export pair keeps
+its captured rows while live observations expire. Its shared window, generation,
+counts and retention limitations remain truthful. Old feedback may survive
+without associated metrics; it cannot authorize unrelated current context.
+Explicit truncate still removes feedback and invalidates prepared pairs/retries.
