+The Operator gains bounded storage upkeep and complete retained exports. Owner
+and Collaborator keep deliberate reports and truthful receipt state. Link guests
+gain no diagnostic authority; document/access retention is unchanged. Reuse
+controlled-time diagnostics fixtures for exact deleted/retained membership,
+accounting, concurrent ingestion/export, bounded failures and cleanup. Keep the
+[complete paired-export contract](SPN-098.md#paired-user-and-system-downloads)
+and the live ticket's cutoff/restart/pressure requirements; no new scheduler or
+general retention system is approved.
